Major Registers, double
<UL>
<LI><b>M220B</b> is a drawing of DEC's M220B.</LI>
<LI><b>M220</b> is DEC's M220 Major Registers card (revision B).</LI>
<LI><b>M220new</b> is an implementation that doesn't use the hard to find
7453 and 7482 chips.</LI>
<LI><b>M220pal</b> is a PAL implementation, using PALs programed with
m220pgm1.pds and m220pgm2.pds.</LI>
